* 7.21.07 prepare myosinV postrigor pdb files from crystal structures
* now that I have determined the histidine states & GLN ASN flips, rebuild the model
* I have manually generated the prigor files using makepdb.inp & modhis scripts
* based on buildv.inp
*

set version 19

stream ../readpsf.str

! HC
open card read unit 1 name hc_mod.pdb
read sequ pdb unit 1
generate HC setup warn first nter last cter 
read coor pdb unit 1 resid
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!11
! LC
open card read unit 1 name lc_mod.pdb
read sequ pdb unit 1
generate LC setup warn first nter last cter
read coor pdb unit 1 resid
! ATP
open card read unit 1 name atp.pdb
read sequ pdb unit 1
generate ATP setup warn 
read coor pdb unit 1 resid 
! MG
open card read unit 1 name mg.pdb
read sequ pdb unit 1
generate MG setup warn 
read coor pdb unit 1 resid 
! crystal waters

set offset ?nres
read sequ TIP3 525
generate XWAT nodihe noangle
open card read unit 1 name xwat.pdb
read coor pdb unit 1 offset @offset
!
! flag  xray atoms -- these will be fixed later;

coor init select hydrogen end
hbuild

define unknown select .not. init end
if ?nsel .ne. 0 stop

write psf card name prigor_prot@version.psf
write coor card name prigor_prot@version.cor






